[3855]="7004BE4B\n1\tObserva una mosca pestilente sangrienta en Agarnaith\030Observa un acechador del pantano sanguinario en Agarnaith\030Observa un cuervo de sangre en Agarnaith\030Observa una rata pestilente infecciosa en Agarnaith\030Derrota jabalíes de los pantanos enfermos en Agarnaith (total: 4)\030Derrota lobos terribles afectados por la plaga en Agarnaith (total: 4)\tTancram te ha pedido que derrotes jabalíes y lobos en Agarnaith, afectada por la plaga, y que observes a varias otras criaturas para evaluar la propagación de la enfermedad.\n2\tLleva tu informe sobre la propagación de la enfermedad a Tancram en el Salón del Rey\tTancram está en el Salón del Rey.\n",
[3856]="7004BE46\n1\tDefeat enemies in Dor Amarth (total: 8)\tVórthi asked you to defeat foes in Dor Amarth before delivering the package to Góthur.\n2\tGóthur is by a lake of fire to the south-west of Mordath, the great pit over which Barad-dûr once towered.\t\n3\tHabla con Vórthi en el Salón Bajo la Montaña\tVórthi is in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor.\n4\tHabla con Vórthi en el Salón Bajo la Montaña\tVórthi is in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor.\n",
[3857]="7004BE6D\n1\tCollect Easterling food jars in Rhûd Vorn (total: 8)\tFood jars can be found at Rhûd Vorn, an Easterling camp on the eastern side of Udûn.\n2\tBring the food jars to Aster Hayward in Tham Periain\tAster Guardacercas está en Tham Periain.\n",
[3858]="7004BE7D\n1\tNurnhoth captives can be found within the fortress of Naerband, in southern Talath Úrui.\t\n2\tTalk to Aster Hayward in Tham Periain\tAster Guardacercas está en Tham Periain.\n",
[3859]="7004BE7E\n1\tRecoge semillas viajeras de los nerbyg y las moscas de la peste en Agarnaith (total: 6)\030Recoge hierbas enredadas de los acechadores del pantano en Agarnaith (total: 3)\tEn los pantanos de Agarnaith, se pueden encontrar semillas viajeras de los nerbyg y las moscas de la peste, y hierbas enredadas de los acechadores del pantano.\n2\tLleva los objetos que has recogido a Aster Guardacercas en Tham Periain\tAster Guardacercas está en Tham Periain.\n",
[3860]="7004BE7C\n1\tCollect combustible powder from Fushaum Tum (total: 4)\030Collect parchment paper from Fushaum Tum (total: 4)\030Collect pinches of Doomfold sulfur from fire grims and salamanders in Dor Amarth (total: 4)\tCombustible powder and parchment paper can be found throughout the Fushaum Tum encampment, in Dor Amarth. Pinches of Doomfold sulfur can be obtained from salamanders and fire grims throughout Dor Amarth.\n2\tBring the items Pippin requested to Aster Hayward\tAster Guardacercas está en Tham Periain.\n",
[3861]="7004BE7B\n1\tDefeat spiders in Lhingris (total: 14)\tSpiders can be found in great numbers throughout Lhingris.\n2\tTalk to Aster Hayward in Tham Periain\tAster Guardacercas está en Tham Periain.\n",
[3862]="7004BE45\n1\tUnload the cart on the road in the north-east of Lhingris, near the entrance to Dor Amarth\tVágrek is with his cart in the north-east of Lhingris, near the road into Dor Amarth.\n2\tFind the Sons of Stone and supply the dwarves with fresh equipment\tThe Sons of Stone are located on the road near Rath Cail in Lhingris.\n3\tFind the Crow-feeders and supply the dwarves with fresh equipment\tThe Crow-feeders are located on the road south of Rath Cail in Lhingris.\n4\tBring the remaining equipment to Unvíth just north of the Crow-feeders\tUnvíth is just north of the Crow-feeders.\n",
[3863]="7004BE51\n1\tDefeat rock-worms or fire grims in Dor Amarth (total: 14)\030Defeat dire-horns, sûlokil, or fire-drakes in Dor Amarth (total: 6)\tGlórellas asked you to defeat foes in Dor Amarth, choosing between rock-worms, dire-horns, and a number of other creatures, in order to aid the Elves that fight in that land.\n2\tHabla con Glórellas en la Corte de Celeborn\tGlórellas está en la Corte de Celeborn.\n",
[3864]="7004BE54\n1\tGive lembas to hungry Elf-warriors in Udûn (total: 2)\030Give water-skins to thirsty Elf-warriors in Udûn (total: 2)\030Give hopeful words to melancholy Elf-warriors in Udûn (total: 2)\tGlórellas gave you a number of packages to give to Elf-warriors on the road to Anglach, in Udûn.\n2\tHabla con Glórellas en la Corte de Celeborn\tGlórellas está en la Corte de Celeborn.\n",
[3865]="7004BE6C\n1\tDefeat the primary food-sources for the spiders in Lhingris (cantidad: según el diario)\tBats, maggots, burrowers, and flies serve as the primary food-sources for spiders in Lhingris.\n2\tHabla con Glórellas en la Corte de Celeborn\tGlórellas está en la Corte de Celeborn.\n",
[3866]="7004BE47\n1\tSet up a keg for parched dwarves north-east of Thorzhaf, in Talath Úrui\tThere is a good spot for a keg north-east of Thorzhaf, in Talath Úrui.\n2\tSet up a keg for parched dwarves east of Thorzhaf, in Talath Úrui\tThere is a good spot for a keg east of Thorzhaf, in Talath Úrui.\n3\tSet up a keg for parched dwarves north of the road between Naerband and the Ghâshghurm\tThere is a good spot for a keg north of the road in Talath Úrui, between Naerband and the Ghâshghurm.\n4\tHabla con Vórthi en el Salón Bajo la Montaña\tVórthi se encuentra en el Salón Bajo la Montaña.\n",
[3867]="7004BE50\n1\tDefeat enemies in Lhingris (total: 14)\tTancram asked you to defeat your foes in Lhingris before meeting up with Fairdal, north of the cross-roads east of Cirith Ungol, in Rath Cail.\n2\tNow that you have faced many foes in Lhingris, you should find Fairdal north of the cross-roads east of Cirith Ungol, in Rath Cail, and hear his report.\t\n3\tTalk to Tancram in the Hall of the King\tTancram está en el Salón del Rey.\n",
[3868]="7004BE49\n1\tTancram gave you a number of banners to raise over Dor Amarth.\t\n2\tTalk to Tancram in the Hall of the King\tTancram está en el Salón del Rey.\n",
[3869]="7004BE48\n1\tDerrota crébains o moscas guadaña en Agarnaith (total: 18)\030Derrota jabalíes o lobos en Agarnaith (total: 12)\030Derrota orcos o uruks en Agarnaith (total: 8)\tVórthi te pidió que eligieras enemigos a derrotar en Agarnaith, y sin importar a quién enfrentes, estarás haciendo que el pantano sea más seguro.\n2\tHabla con Vórthi en el Salón Bajo la Montaña\tVórthi se encuentra en el Salón Bajo la Montaña.\n",
[3870]="7004BE52\n1\tDefeat hostile foes in Talath Úrui (total: 10)\tGlórellas asked you to defeat enemies in Talath Úrui before finding Candithil and obtaining his report.\n2\tCandithil is near the cross-roads south-east of Orodruin, in Talath Úrui.\t\n3\tHabla con Glórellas en la Corte de Celeborn\tGlórellas está en la Corte de Celeborn.\n",
[3871]="7004BE4A\n1\tDefeat salamanders or rock-worms in Talath Úrui (total: 14)\030Defeat fire-drakes in Talath Úrui (total: 4)\tSalamanders, rock-worms, and fire-drakes can be found throughout Talath Úrui.\n2\tTalk to Tancram in the Hall of the King\tTancram está en el Salón del Rey.\n",
[3872]="7004BE4C\n1\tHang the repaired Thandrim shield on the wall outside the entrance to Durthang, in Udûn\tTancram gave you a shield to hang on a wall outside the entrance to Durthang, so you may fight in memory of the fallen Thandrim.\n2\tDefeat enemies within Durthang in memory of the Thandrim (total: 12)\tTancram asked you to defeat enemies within the fortress of Durthang, in Udûn.\n3\tRetrieve the shield of the Thandrim from the wall where you placed it\tYou placed a repaired shield of the Thandrim on a wall outside the entrance to Durthang, in Udûn, and should now retrieve it.\n4\tBring the repaired Thandrim shield to Tancram in the Hall of the King\tTancram está en el Salón del Rey.\n",
